<title>UK: Allgemeine Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Allgemeine Hypo sets 100 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.125    MATURITY  **10.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    10.OCT.96</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEAR ONE THEN STEPS UP TO 5.0 PCT YEAR TWO,</p>
<p>		 5.50 PCT YEAR THREE, 6.0 PCT YEAR FOUR AND 7.75 PCT</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     **CALLABLE ON 10.OCT.97</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
